RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter	LangChain text-splitting utility
chunk_size=500	Maximum chunk size in characters
chunk_overlap=100	Repeated characters between chunks
split_text(text)	Divides the text into chunks
enumerate(chunks, start=1)	Numbers the chunks
write()	Saves each chunk to a file


